<view class="container"><view class="hero"><view class="h1">好友与群组</view><view class="sub">用轻量提醒和点赞，一起坚持下去</view></view><view class="card" data-url="/pages/circle/friends" bindtap="go"><view class="row"><view class="row-start"><image class="circle-icon" src="/assets/categories/friends.png" mode="aspectFit"/><view><view class="h2">好友</view><view class="sub">管理特别关心与好友可见状态</view></view></view><view>›</view></view></view><view class="card" data-url="/pages/circle/groups" bindtap="go"><view class="row"><view class="row-start"><image class="circle-icon" src="/assets/categories/groups.png" mode="aspectFit"/><view><view class="h2">自律群组</view><view class="sub">只广播打卡动态，不设置群聊</view></view></view><view>›</view></view></view><view class="section-title">特别关心动态</view><view class="card"><view class="list-item care-event" wx:for="{{feed}}" wx:key="_id"><view class="row"><view class="value">{{item.nickname}} 完成了「{{item.planName}}」</view><view class="sub">{{item.displayTime}}</view></view></view><view class="empty compact" wx:if="{{loading && !feed.length}}">正在加载…</view><view class="empty compact" wx:elif="{{!feed.length}}">设为特别关心后，对方的打卡会出现在这里</view></view></view>
